"who": "corvin"
}],
"title": "Enemies at Broken Crossing"
}, {
"at": "gallowmere",
"giver": "ash_lena",
"have": 0,
"id": "story_ferry1",
"pitch": "Before the lake died, my husband rowed people out to the isles. His boat went down off Hrafnsey, <dir:R:wreck_hrafn_0:gallowmere> of here, across the sea. His log was aboard.",
"reward": {
"items": [["cloth", 6], ["wood", 20]],
"rep": 2,
"salt": 60
},
"stage": 0,
"state": "offered",
"steps": [{
"crate": "wreck_hrafn_0",
"item": "ferry_log",
"t": "recover",
"text": "Find the ferryman's wreck on the shore of Hrafnsey, <dir:R:wreck_hrafn_0:gallowmere> across the sea, and search it."
}, {
"ask": "His log. It was dry, under the seat.",
"say": "His hand. Every crossing, every name, every fare. He wrote down the weather too, like it mattered to anyone.

The last page is not a crossing. It says: the chapel on the fen rings by itself at night. Someone must take the bell away, or it will call them all. Then nothing.",
"t": "talk",
"take": ["ferry_log", 1],
"text": "Bring the log to Lena at Gallowmere.",
"who": "ash_lena"
}],
"story": "ferry1",
"title": "The Last Crossing"
}],
