"title": "A Nest at Bitter Hollow"
}, {
"at": "hesk",
"giver": "hesk_marro",
"have": 0,
"id": "story_archive",
"pitch": "The Order kept its records in a tower <dir:R:order_tower:hesk> of the Crossing. The ledgers would be worth a great deal to me. And to you.",
"reward": {
"items": [["coin", 4]],
"rep": 2,
"salt": 80
},
"stage": 0,
"state": "offered",
"steps": [{
"ruin": "order_tower",
"t": "reach",
"text": "Find the Archive Tower, <dir:R:order_tower:hesk> of Saint Hesk's Crossing."
}, {
"crate": "order_tower_0",
"item": "keepsake",
"t": "recover",
"text": "Search the tower for the Order's ledgers."
}, {
"ask": "Your ledgers.",
"reveal": "beacons",
"say": "Hm. Accounts of oil carried, salt paid, and keepers fed, beacon by beacon. And here: a map of where each bowl stood, drawn by someone who had walked to every one.

Copy it. You will want it more than I will. The rest I will sell to someone who misses the past.",
"t": "talk",
"take": ["keepsake", 1],
"text": "Bring the ledgers to Marro.",
"who": "hesk_marro"
}],
"story": "archive",
"title": "The Archive Tower"
}, {
"at": "hesk",
"giver": "orla",
"have": 0,
"id": "story_olives",
"pitch": "When I was a girl, ships came from Kalaja with olives. One of them never made it in. It lies on Kalaja's shore, <dir:R:wreck_kala_0:hesk> of here, across the sea.",
"reward": {
"items": [["stew", 2]],
"rep": 2,
"salt": 70
},
"stage": 0,
"state": "offered",
"steps": [{
"crate": "wreck_kala_0",
"item": "olive_cask",
"t": "recover",
"text": "Search the wreck on Kalaja's shore, <dir:R:wreck_kala_0:hesk> across the sea."
}, {
"ask": "One cask, still sealed.",
"say": "Sealed with pitch, and stamped with the keep's mark. My father paid three salt a cask for these.

The keep sold them to keep its garrison fed. I wonder who it was feeding all those years, after the ships stopped.",
"t": "talk",
"take": ["olive_cask", 1],
"text": "Bring the cask to Orla at the Crossing.",
"who": "orla"
}],
"story": "olives",
"title": "Salt for Olives"
}],
