}, {
"at": "kiln",
"giver": "ysolde",
"have": 0,
"id": "story_piet",
"pitch": "My brother Piet went out <dir:R:piet_camp:kiln> of here, toward a dead beacon. He never came back. I cannot make his jar until I know.",
"reward": {
"items": [["salve", 2]],
"rep": 3,
"salt": 60
},
"stage": 0,
"state": "offered",
"steps": [{
"ruin": "piet_camp",
"t": "reach",
"text": "Find Piet's last camp, <dir:R:piet_camp:kiln> of the Quiet Kiln."
}, {
"ruin": "piet_camp",
"t": "nest",
"text": "Something has nested in the camp. Burn it out."
}, {
"crate": "piet_camp_0",
"item": "piet_ring",
"t": "recover",
"text": "Search the camp for anything of Piet's."
}, {
"ask": "I found this at his camp. He did not suffer long, I think.",
"say": "His ring. He wore it on his thumb because his hands were too big for anything else.

I will make his jar tonight. Red clay, his favourite. I will put the ring inside it, and write his name, and then he will be at the Kiln with all the others, and I can stop looking at the door.

Thank you.",
"t": "talk",
"take": ["piet_ring", 1],
"text": "Bring Piet's ring to Ysolde.",
"who": "ysolde"
}],
"story": "piet",
"title": "Piet's Jar"
}, {
"at": "kiln",
"giver": "hal",
"have": 0,
"id": "story_seairon",
"pitch": "My forge is starving. There is good iron in the wrecks off Cogwright, <dir:R:wreck_cog_1:kiln> across the sea. Ship iron rusts only on the skin.",
"reward": {
"items": [["scrap", 20], ["prybar", 1]],
"rep": 2,
"salt": 60
},
"stage": 0,
"state": "offered",
"steps": [{
