"item": "sea_iron",
"t": "recover",
"text": "Search the wreck off Cogwright, <dir:R:wreck_cog_1:kiln> across the sea, for its iron."
}, {
"ask": "Ship iron, as you asked.",
"say": "Look at that. Rust on the skin and sound underneath, like I said.

This will make a good blade, or a better hinge. I will give you one of the first things I make with it.",
"t": "talk",
"take": ["sea_iron", 1],
"text": "Bring the sea iron to Old Hal.",
"who": "hal"
}],
"story": "seairon",
"title": "Iron from the Sea"
}],
