}, {
"at": "mourners",
"giver": "ione",
"have": 0,
"id": "story_seal",
"pitch": "There is a vault in the hills where the Order put its dead. The dead in it are not quiet. Something was sealed in from the inside.",
"reward": {
"items": [["beacon_oil", 1]],
"rep": 3,
"salt": 50
},
"stage": 0,
"state": "offered",
"steps": [{
"ruin": "sealed_vault",
"t": "reach",
"text": "Find the Vault of the Inward Seal, <dir:R:sealed_vault:mourners> of Mourner's Rest."
}, {
"n": 8,
"ruin": "sealed_vault",
"t": "kill",
"text": "Kill the enemies guarding the vault."
}, {
"crate": "sealed_vault_1",
"item": "order_seal",
"t": "recover",
"text": "Force the iron chest within the vault (it wants a pry bar)."
}, {
"ask": "This was pressed into the door from the inside.",
"say": "The Silent Clerics who sealed themselves in. I had heard it, but not believed it.

When the beacons began to die, some of the Order did not run. They walled themselves in with their dead and kept silence until the end, so that the dark would find nothing to speak to. The seal says: we did not answer.

Keep the oil I give you. Light something with it. That is the only answer worth giving.",
"t": "talk",
"take": ["order_seal", 1],
"text": "Bring the seal to Ione.",
"who": "ione"
}],
"story": "seal",
"title": "The Inward Seal"
}],
